{
  "id": 8835553001671,
  "title": "Custom Transportation Semi Truck on Geometric Background Comforter",
  "handle": "custom-transportation-semi-truck-on-geometric-background-comforter-284b7a6d0a-284b7a6d0a",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom with the unique trucker-themed bedding set from Jeminise, designed specifically for truck lovers and legends of the road. This custom comforter set features a modern digital graphic illustration of a semi truck on a geometric background with neon lines, offering a sleek, stylish alternative to traditional bedding. Made from soft and durable polyester, this comfortable bedding is perfect as a thoughtful gift for family and friends, allowing you to add a personalized name to make it truly one of a kind.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features a custom text input allowing you to personalize the bedding set with a custom name of your choice.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping or shifting, providing a lightweight, soft, and breathable sleeping experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant Trucker Theme:</strong> Decorated with a vibrant digital illustration of a semi truck, shipping containers, and neon geometric patterns that resist fading thanks to advanced eco-friendly printing techniques.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in standard US bedding sizes including Twin (68\" x 88\"), Full (78\" x 88\"), Queen (88\" x 88\"), and King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Flexible Components:</strong> Includes one comforter (or duvet cover) and option to add matching pillowcases or a flat sheet cover to complete your bedroom decor.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water on a gentle cycle; air dry or tumble dry on low heat to maintain fluffiness and durability.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Blue Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Trucker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
